hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20595","Hajjaj narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to me, from Qatadah, from 'Abd al-Rahman Abu al-Minhal ibn Salamah al-Khuza'i, from his uncle, that the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said to Aslam: Fast today. They said: We have already eaten. He said: Fast the rest of your day, meaning the day of 'Ashura'."
